<decision #mission.depa_orm_domain_workbench.bundle_policy {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  durable_candidate = true
  confidence = "high"
  reversibility = "medium; v2 can add an explicit authoring mode without changing v1 execution semantics"
}
(
  <question ?>Kon bundle 是否允许在线编辑并重新编译，运行数据状态如何管理？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>采用 A：Kon bundle 只读；每次执行从 seed 创建隔离数据库，执行后返回快照并销毁。</?>
    <decision-text ?>v1 不在线编辑或重新编译 Kon；每个 execute request 使用 fresh seeded SQLite，结束后销毁。</?>
    <rationale ?>保证预制模型可复现，避免页面状态和数据库状态成为第二事实源，同时把在线 authoring 留给后续独立能力。</?>
    <evidence ?>用户明确选择两个问题的 A；当前 SPL 与 Cozo 工作台都提供 fresh execution 可借鉴，但本 mission 进一步要求数据库也按请求隔离。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #mission.depa_orm_domain_workbench.runtime_primary_key_mutation_targeting {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  durable_candidate = true
  confidence = "high"
  reversibility = "medium"
}
(
  <question ?>How should storage-neutral RuntimeMutation update/delete acquire an exact public Writer target?</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>The host runtime derives equality targeting from the compiled entity primary key carried in mutation values.</?>
    <decision-text ?>Preserve RuntimeMutation shape; create forwards unchanged, update/delete receive model-derived primary-key where, and missing/invalid keys fail before Writer IO.</?>
    <rationale ?>Runtime owns public Writer adaptation. Bundle-owned predicates, hard-coded id, or changed SQLite unscoped semantics would violate authority and mechanism boundaries.</?>
    <evidence ?>G7 multi-row duplicate-key reproduction, public Writer/SQLite contracts, and fresh plan-track coding AttractorCheck PASS.</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #mission.depa_orm_domain_workbench.operation_scope {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  durable_candidate = true
  confidence = "high"
  reversibility = "low; narrowing back to BO Action would break the accepted operation surface"
}
(
  <question ?>工作台中的可执行 Operation 是否只包含 BO Action？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>否；还包括 BO Mutation、BO 批量操作、非 BO 原始操作、自定义组合 API，以及 Association、Lifecycle、Constraint、BusinessProcess 等概念的操作。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Operation 是跨 owner 的统一调用模型，不能收缩为 BO Action。</?>
    <rationale ?>兄弟项目证据同时存在 Action、Mutation、BusinessProcess、Association、Lifecycle、Constraint 和 raw/analytics operation。</?>
    <evidence ?>framework-dsl、ontology v5 与 Cozo OM 的实际资源和执行 API。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #mission.depa_orm_domain_workbench.operation_dimensions {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  durable_candidate = true
  confidence = "high"
  reversibility = "medium; individual value sets may evolve while the orthogonal dimensions remain stable"
}
(
  <question ?>如何避免 Operation kind 枚举随能力增长而不断膨胀？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>采用 owner、behavior、subject、effect 的正交拆分，并在 selection/batch 讨论后把 invocation 独立为第五维。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Operation 使用 owner、behavior、subject、invocation、effect 五个正交维度；atomicity 不属于 identity，由 definition capability 与 request execution 独立表达。</?>
    <rationale ?>owner、行为类型、主语形状、调用数量和事实影响是不同问题，分列后可以组合而不制造大量复合 kind；事务能力与本次选择又是另一组事实。</?>
    <evidence ?>用户明确同意四维模型，并接受把 batch 从 subject 中拆为 invocation 维度的设计。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #mission.depa_orm_domain_workbench.selection_semantics {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  durable_candidate = true
  confidence = "high"
  reversibility = "medium; wire aliases can be migrated but the semantic distinction must remain"
}
(
  <question ?>原 collection subject 应如何命名并与 batch 区分？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>collection 类似用 selector 圈定一批 subject，应改名避免与 batch 歧义；selection 设计已确认。</?>
    <decision-text ?>subject 使用 none、single、selection；selection 由 all/filter/ids selector 圈定一个逻辑主语集合，batch 表示多个独立 invocation。</?>
    <rationale ?>selection 回答对谁做，batch 回答一次请求做多少个独立调用；每个 batch item 拥有独立 subject value、payload、key 和结果，但 subject shape 与 verb 由同一个 Operation definition 约束。</?>
    <evidence ?>用户对 selection 命名和语义明确表示满意。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #mission.depa_orm_domain_workbench.contract_boundary {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  durable_candidate = true
  confidence = "high"
  reversibility = "medium; package naming can change while the independent ownership boundary remains"
}
(
  <question ?>HTTP API 和共享 DTO 应由哪个 package 拥有？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>希望关系数据库方案与兄弟项目在思想上趋同，并尽可能使用一套标准 HTTP API。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Domain Operation catalog/execute DTO 由独立 transport-neutral contract capsule 拥有，不放入 SPL 专属 web-shared。</?>
    <rationale ?>标准 contract 需要被 server、IDE 和未来其他 runtime 复用，不能被当前 SPL 页面或 Elysia implementation 绑定。</?>
    <evidence ?>DEPA capsule/owner 边界和当前 workspace 的 shared DTO 模式。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #mission.depa_orm_domain_workbench.runtime_boundary {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  durable_candidate = true
  confidence = "high"
  reversibility = "low; bypassing public APIs or capability checks would invalidate correctness claims"
}
(
  <question ?>工作台如何使用 depa-orm 并表达事务与可观测能力？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>基于 depa-orm 管理关系数据库和本体语义，执行后能够直观看到效果。</?>
    <decision-text ?>只依赖 depa-orm 公共入口；每请求独立 runtime；atomic、batch item mapping 和 SQL trace 先做 capability audit，不支持时显式 diagnostic，禁止静默降级。</?>
    <rationale ?>当前公开 API 的单 mutation、transaction capability 和 trace 边界需要事实验证；以公开能力为真源可避免工作台依赖 tests 或 internals。</?>
    <evidence ?>depa-orm public Reader/Writer/storage contracts 与 capsule architecture tests。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #mission.depa_orm_domain_workbench.v1_scope {
  priority = "P1"
  status = "superseded"
  durable_candidate = true
