}
(
  <question ?>首版是通用本体执行引擎，还是用于验证统一机制的关系数据库工作台？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>希望传统数据库方案与兄弟项目思想趋同，并通过多套预制 bundle 和 actions/operations 直观验证。</?>
    <decision-text ?>v1 用代表性 DomainContextBundle 和 Operation matrix 验证机制，不实现通用 ontology engine，也不直接依赖兄弟 XML grammar。</?>
    <rationale ?>可以覆盖已确认概念，同时避免把规范差异、任意代码执行和跨 runtime portability 一次性引入。</?>
    <evidence ?>ontology v5 与 ontology-xml-dsl 当前 grammar 存在差异；用户核心目标是关系数据库原型工作台。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #mission.depa_orm_domain_workbench.ontology_xml_superset {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "superseded"
  durable_candidate = true
  confidence = "high"
  reversibility = "low; reintroducing upper/lower ownership mixing would create duplicate structural truth"
}
(
  <question ?>ontology-xml-dsl 如何同时覆盖现有类型机制、v5 业务概念和 Domain Operation 定义？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>只要最新版本；保留不与 v5 重叠的 Module 能力，但类型系统必须独立，BusinessObject 只是其支持的一个上层功能，未来还可能有 PageObject，坚决不允许混杂上层和底层。</?>
    <decision-text ?>采用单一 latest-only Resources grammar。TypeModule、RelationModule、RuleModule、LifecycleModule 保持底层 authority；BusinessObject、Association、DomainPolicy、BusinessProcess、Capability 等 profile 只引用底层声明；Operation catalog 在更上层引用 owner 和类型并表达 selection/batch preset。移除旧 Ontology/Modules 装配入口。</?>
    <rationale ?>类型系统的表达能力决定整个体系上限。把 BO 属性、Association 端点或 Policy 条件重新定义在上层会锁死扩展并制造双重真源；分层引用允许未来 PageObject 等新 profile 复用同一内核。</?>
    <evidence ?>用户明确接受除类型混合外的大部分梳理，并进一步确认按 lower-kernel / upper-profile / operation-definition 分层实施。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #mission.depa_orm_domain_workbench.fs_native_ontology_manifest_authority {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "accepted"
  durable_candidate = true
  confidence = "high"
  reversibility = "low; restoring Resources or Modules would recreate a second assembly authority"
}
(
  <question ?>G4 目标升级后，哪套 ontology XML grammar 和 workspace 承担 latest authority？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>Replan 009 已把目标改为 FS-native manifest 和 depa-ontology.ts authority；mission gap-loop round 1 证明历史 Cozo archive 仍是 Resources grammar，而 depa-knowledge-base.cs 已存在目标实现但缺少真实 track。</?>
    <decision-text ?>FS-native KindDefinition 声明的精确 manifest entry 是唯一 latest assembly；当前 `Ontology` 入口为 `Manifest.xml`，并明确拒绝大小写别名、`Resources`、`Modules` 和 per-resource `href`；`depa-knowledge-base.cs` 中的 ontology-exchange-xml-standard 是本 mission 的 latest definition workspace，depa-ontology.ts 是 Bun OM capability authority，历史 Cozo Resources track 仅保留为 legacy evidence。</?>
    <rationale ?>当前 proposal/design 已要求 manifest grammar；继续把历史 Resources archive 当作 latest evidence 会使 completed gate 虚假通过。为现有 latest workspace 建立 correction track 可恢复真实 ownership，同时保留历史可追溯性。</?>
    <evidence ?>reports/replan-009-ontology-ts-source-authority.md、reports/mission-gap-loop-report-1.md，以及 depa-knowledge-base.cs 的 FS-native validator 58/58 证据。</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #mission.depa_orm_domain_workbench.depa_orm_library_gap {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "resolved"
  durable_candidate = true
  confidence = "high"
  reversibility = "medium; a future public capability regression or new requirement may justify a separate library track"
}
(
  <question ?>已确认的 v1 语义是否需要先修改 depa-orm 公共 API？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>G2 public capability audit completed without a correctness-blocking library gap.</?>
    <decision-text ?>不创建 depa-orm external track；同 datasource composed atomic 由 host adapter 使用 public outer transaction 实现，跨 datasource atomic 拒绝，row-level mapping 与 SQL trace 不可用时返回 diagnostics。</?>
    <rationale ?>Public storage transactions can compose nested Writer calls atomically and return invocation-level results. Missing SQL observability and row-level mapping do not block the accepted v1 response contract because they are explicitly capability-gated.</?>
    <evidence ?>Public entrypoint/storage/pipeline tests passed, cross-call composition tests passed, and an independent public-API in-memory probe verified rollback and commit behavior.</?>
  )
  >
)>

<decision #mission.depa_orm_domain_workbench.preset_request_authority {
  priority = "P0"
  status = "resolved"
  durable_candidate = true
  confidence = "high"
  reversibility = "low; restoring shadow request fields would recreate split authority"
}
(
  <question ?>Operation preset、definition、binding、server 与 request 如何共享一套标准 HTTP 语义？</?>
  <answer { }
  (
    <raw-answer ?>External ontology G4 的完整 RequestJson 与 host drift spot-check 已冻结：preview 必须原样 POST，capability 事实按层分离。</?>
    <decision-text ?>Preset 保存完整 ExecuteOperationRequest v1；definition 拥有五维、静态 verb 与 requestable capabilities；binding 拥有 actual capabilities；server 拥有 current projection；request 拥有本次 execution choice。runtime 只验证交集，不重建 request 或推导隐藏默认。</?>
    <rationale ?>一份完整 request 消除 UI/bundle/server 的影子模型；分层 capability authority 防止 definition default、binding support 与环境状态互相冒充。</?>
    <evidence ?>Ontology XML canonical presets/validator、host preset-contract drift report 与 correction track attractor review。</?>
  )
  >
)>
